@node Convert links to citations
@subsection Convert links to citations

@findex tlon-convert-links-to-cite
The command @code{tlon-convert-links-to-cite} iterates through all Markdown links in the current buffer. When a link's URL matches the @samp{url} field of an entry in the Tlon bibliography, it prompts you to convert the link to a @samp{<Cite>} tag using the corresponding Bib@TeX{} key.

@node Convert bibliography to citations
@subsection Convert bibliography to citations

@findex tlon-convert-bibliography-to-cite
The command @code{tlon-convert-bibliography-to-cite} converts plain-text bibliography entries (in the ``Author, Title (Year)'' format) to @samp{<Cite>} tags. It looks up the Bib@TeX{} key based on the title. This command should be run with the buffer narrowed to the bibliography section, as it assumes one work per line and does not handle locators.

@node Replace keys with formatted citations
@subsection Replace keys with formatted citations

@findex tlon-bib-replace-keys-with-citations
The command @code{tlon-bib-replace-keys-with-citations} replaces all @samp{<Cite>} tags in a file (or the current buffer) with formatted citations fetched from the Tlon API@. The citation style (``short'' or ``long'') is determined by the @samp{length} attribute in each @samp{<Cite>} tag. When the optional audio argument is non-nil, the corresponding audio citation styles are used instead.

@findex tlon-bib-replace-keys-with-citations-in-dir
The command @code{tlon-bib-replace-keys-with-citations-in-dir} applies this recursively to all Markdown files in the current directory.

@node Check Bib@TeX{} keys
@subsection Check Bib@TeX{} keys

@findex tlon-bib-check-bibkeys
The command @code{tlon-bib-check-bibkeys} validates all Bib@TeX{} keys inside @samp{<Cite>} tags in the current buffer, a specified file, or an active region. A key is valid if it exists in the bibliography (as determined by @code{tlon-bibliography-lookup}). The command reports any invalid keys found.

@node AI-powered citation tools
@section AI-powered citation tools

@menu
* Replace citations in file::
